Agentic Movie Studio
Copyright 2026 Abandoned Muse and Agentic Movie Studio contributors

Agentic Movie Studio includes and adapts Apache-2.0-licensed work from the
ScriptBreak project and related filmmaking modules. The original ScriptBreak
repository is available at:

  https://github.com/wassermanproductions/scriptbreak

The inherited work includes screenplay parsing, breakdown, bibles, look and
shot-list concepts, scheduling, prompt packs, export behavior, index-card
planning, per-shot prompt/take concepts, and storyboard metadata concepts.

Original copyright notices are preserved in LICENSE and the module-level
NOTICE files as required by the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The architecture and substantial changes in this derivative application are
described in ARCHITECTURE.md.
